    <description>Bo sung You_are__c cho Lead theo Record Type: Student -&gt; Student, Guardian -&gt; Guardian.

CHI DIEN KHI You_are__c DANG RONG - tuyet doi khong ghi de. Ly do: You_are__c co 5 gia tri, trong khi
Lead chi co 2 Record Type. Flow Lead_Auto_Assign_RecordType (chieu nguoc lai) gom &quot;Student/Working
people/BUV Alumni&quot; ve RT Student va &quot;Guardian/Parent&quot; ve RT Guardian. Neu flow nay ghi de thi tren
UAT2 se lam hong 31 Lead dang la &quot;Parent&quot; va 2 Lead dang la &quot;Working people&quot; (do 24/09/2026).

Vi sao can: 2 Validation Rule bat buoc You_are__c (You_are_cannot_be_blank, API_Gate1_Required_YouAre)
chi phu kenh nhap tay va API. Lead vao qua Import / Facebook / Digital khong bi chan nen co the rong.

Before-save nen khong ton them DML va khong tao vong lap voi Lead_Auto_Assign_RecordType: hai flow
co dieu kien loai tru nhau (flow kia chi chay khi You_are__c CO gia tri).</description>
